  user_2,Hello Pooja, this is Karan from Safe Step Insurance. Can you hear me? [00:00]
  user_1,Umm...yeah, hi Karan. I can hear you. [00:01]
  user_2,Great. How are you doing today? [00:01]
  user_1,I'm... okay, just a bit busy, you know. [00:02]
  user_2,No worries. I see you have an auto policy with us. Is that right? [00:02]
  user_1,Yes, that's correct. Policy number... uh... I think it's AUTO-4598. [00:03]
  user_2,Let me pull that up. One sec, please hold. [00:04]
  user_2,[hold music playing]
  user_2,Thanks for waiting. I have your policy here. [00:06]
  user_1,[typing] ... okay. [00:07]
  user_2,Looks like the policy is scheduled to be cancelled on 15/10/2026. Did you request that? [00:07]
