  user_2,Alright, we can go through the options. Are you looking to cancel entirely or maybe adjust coverage? [00:09]
  user_1,Honestly, I'm thinking of selling the car soon, so maybe cancel. But I also worry about any fees. [00:10]
  user_2,Got it. Let me check the cancellation fees. One moment, please hold. [00:11]
  user_2,[hold music playing]
  user_2,Okay, thanks for holding. The fee is $45 plus any outstanding premium. [00:13]
  user_1,That's... okay. Is there any way to waive it? [00:14]
  user_2,We can see if you qualify for a fee waiver if you have a good claim history. Let me check. [00:15]
  user_2,[typing] ... checking... [00:16]
  user_2,All good, you have no claims in the past 3 years. I can waive the $45 fee. [00:17]
  user_1,Oh wow, thanks! So the cancellation will be effective immediately? [00:18]
  user_2,We can process it today. It'll be effective as of 30/09/2026. Does that work? [00:19]
  user_1,Yeah, that's fine. Actually... I have a question about the refund of the prepaid premium. [00:20]
  user_2,Sure, let me pull that. One sec. [00:21]
  user_2,[hold music playing]
  user_2,Okay, you have $120 prepaid for the next 6 months. We'll prorate and refund $80. [00:23]
  user_1,Great. How will I get the refund? [00:24]
  user_2,We'll issue a direct deposit to the bank on file. Does that sound good? [00:25]
  user_1,Yes, perfect. [00:26]
  user_2,Alright, I'm processing the cancellation now. Please hold while I finalize. [00:27]
  user_2,[hold music playing]
  user_2,All set! Your policy is now cancelled. You'll receive a confirmation email shortly. [00:30]
  user_1,Thanks, Karan. Oh, by the way, did you see the rain this morning? [00:31]
  user_2,Haha, yeah, it was crazy. Stayed dry? [00:32]
  user_1,[dog barks in background] ... yeah, kind of. My dog is freaking out. [00:33]
  user_2,Hope he settles. Anything else I can help with? [00:34]
